Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||11-25-1999||12:28 AM||||Personally I like the interiors. Not in bright yellow, mind you.. Only thing I'd prefer is if the dash was more integrated with the console. <P> <A HREF="http://www.gscustom.com/europe.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gscustom.com/europe.htm</A> <P>I still haven't seen a replacement door panel that I like either. PISA one is ok I guess, but does anyone know of a different design?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||11-28-1999||12:06 AM||||I think it looks generic.  I'm designing and building my own based on the wrap-around PISA design for about $150.  Doesn't anybody else think that 3 grand is a little expensive?!?||||reg||1
Z||000004||JetroGT||11-29-1999||05:20 AM||||<BR>I like the interior kit in the Russian built Fiero. But I don't know if it comes as a kit or not. I've seen this car close up the first time that I went to the Dell's Run in Wisconsin. The other custom interiors that I have seen seem too plain.  <A HREF="http://members.tripod.com/fiero_man_10/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://members.tripod.com/fiero_man_10/index.html</A> <P>||||reg||6
